                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game here really managed to turn a peaceful story into an exciting one! Currently you are able to play 3 chapters of this game and I can't wait for the next update and finally play it's next chapter. \r\nIt even proves, that pixel arts can still be beautiful and gave me the oldschool, classic click and point game vibes. All of it's riddles so far were challenging, but fair! I've only needed to peek one time into a walkthrough, but all of the other riddles were solveable after some more exploring. Your diary's always able to help you out, if you should forget your next task(s). \r\nSo yes, I can highly recommend it. But keep in mind, that it's still an Early Access game.",
